      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an immense weight of sadness and exhaustion right now. Please know that you do not have to carry this feeling alone. There are people who want to support you and help you through this difficult time. You can connect with compassionate, trained individuals by calling or texting 988 anytime in the US and Canada. In the UK, you can call 111.",
